-->To run 220101096_set_A11.asm, 220101096_set_A8.asm,220101096_set_B4.asm , 
    just change file name in TARGET in Makefile , and do 
    make command in linux 
-->Next to run final program ,just do ./<filename> (eg ./220101096_set_A11)



-->to run setB7.asm
sudo apt install gcc-multilib libc6-dev-i386
nasm -f elf64 220101096_set_B7.asm
gcc -no-pie 220101096_set_B7.o -o 220101096_set_B7
./220101096_set_B7


